---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { pageSeo } from "../seo/registry.mjs";
---

<SiteLayout metadata={pageSeo["/certified-scrummaster-training"]}>
	<main id="main" class="csm-page">
		<section class="csm-hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Scrum Alliance® credential</p><h1>Certified ScrumMaster® Training</h1><p class="framing-line">The official Certified ScrumMaster® course, delivered by trainers who have been part of the Scrum Alliance story since the founding era.</p><p class="hero-action"><a class="primary-cta" href="/contact/">Request an on-site (or private virtual) course</a></p></div><aside class="credential-panel" aria-label="Certified ScrumMaster credential"><img src="/assets/courses/sa-csm.png" alt="Scrum Alliance Certified ScrumMaster certification badge" width="150" height="150" /><p>Official CSM® credential</p></aside></div></section>
		<section class="section what-is-section section-rule"><div class="shell content-grid"><h2>What the CSM is</h2><div class="body-copy"><p>The Certified ScrumMaster® (CSM®) is the foundational credential from Scrum Alliance. It gives you a solid understanding of the Scrum framework: accountabilities, events, and artifacts, and the practical skill to apply it with a real team.</p><p>The course is 16 hours of live instruction taught by a Certified Scrum Trainer®. There are no formal prerequisites. After the course you take the Scrum Alliance exam (50 questions, 37 correct to pass). Two attempts are included. Upon passing you receive the CSM certification and membership.</p></div></div></section>
		<section class="why-section"><div class="shell why-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Why take it with 3Back</p><h2>Delivered continuously from the days of inception to the present.</h2></div><div class="why-copy"><p>More than 25,000 students have trained with us. We know what it takes for the credential to stick in real organizations, not just on a résumé.</p><p>Our classes emphasize judgment and applied practice. You leave able to guide a team, not just recite the framework.</p></div></div></section>
		<section class="section inclusions-section section-rule"><div class="shell content-grid"><h2>What you get with 3Back</h2><div class="body-copy"><ul class="inclusions-list"><li>Official 16-hour CSM course taught by a Certified Scrum Trainer®</li><li>Scrum Study Guide</li><li>Practice exams</li><li>Access to our LMS for course materials and exam preparation</li><li>Exam fee and two attempts included</li><li>Two-year Scrum Alliance membership upon passing</li><li>99% pass rate supported by the Study Guide, practice exams, and LMS</li></ul><p class="resource-line"><a href="/downloads/certified-scrummaster-data-sheet.pdf">Download the CSM data sheet</a> for the full agenda and logistics details.</p><p class="resource-line">Questions about the credential or course logistics? See the <a href="/scrum-alliance-courses-faq/#certified-scrummaster">Scrum Alliance Courses FAQ</a>.</p></div></div></section>
		<section class="section teams-section section-rule"><div class="shell content-grid"><h2>How teams take the course</h2><div class="body-copy"><p>Most organizations that work with us bring the course in as private training: onsite or virtual, so the whole group learns the same language and practices together.</p><p>Open enrollment seats are also available through our scheduled events when that fits better.</p><p>Either path leads to the same credential and the same preparation support.</p><p class="team-actions"><a class="primary-cta" href="/contact/">Request an on-site (or private virtual) course</a><a class="secondary-cta" href="/events">View course schedule</a></p></div></div></section>
		<section class="section audience-section"><div class="shell content-grid"><h2>Who this is for</h2><div class="body-copy"><p>Primarily for leaders and managers who are sending people or whole teams.</p><p>It is also right for individuals who want to become a more effective member of a Scrum team. The CSM teaches the skills that let one person contribute to a team that actually works.</p></div></div></section>
		<section class="closing-actions"><div class="shell"><h2>Choose the right course path.</h2><div class="closing-links"><a class="primary-cta" href="/contact/">Request an on-site (or private virtual) course</a><a class="secondary-cta" href="/events">View course schedule</a><a class="secondary-cta" href="/downloads/certified-scrummaster-data-sheet.pdf">Download the CSM data sheet</a><a class="secondary-cta" href="/scrum-alliance-courses-faq/#certified-scrummaster">Scrum Alliance Courses FAQ</a></div><p class="attribution">Certified ScrumMaster® is a certification mark of Scrum Alliance, Inc.</p></div></section>
	</main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
	.csm-hero { padding: 110px 0 84px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); } .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 270px; gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 100px); align-items: end; } .hero-copy { max-width: 840px; } .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--amber-text); font-size: var(--type-caption); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heavy); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caption); text-transform: uppercase; } .hero-copy h1 { margin-bottom: 24px; } .framing-line { max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: var(--type-lead); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); line-height: var(--leading-lead); } .hero-action { margin: 0; }
	.primary-cta, .secondary-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 12px 19px; font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); line-height: 1.25; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; } .primary-cta { border: 2px solid var(--amber); background: var(--amber); color: var(--charcoal); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--charcoal); } .primary-cta:hover { background: var(--charcoal); border-color: var(--charcoal); color: var(--paper); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--amber); } .secondary-cta { border: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit; } .secondary-cta:hover { background: var(--charcoal); border-color: var(--charcoal); color: var(--paper); }
	.credential-panel { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 13px; padding: 34px 24px; border-top: 5px solid var(--amber); text-align: center; } .credential-panel img { width: 150px; height: 150px; object-fit: contain; } .credential-panel p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--type-caption); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.45fr); gap: clamp(32px, 8vw, 130px); } .content-grid h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.4rem); } .body-copy { max-width: 720px; } .body-copy p { font-size: 1.125rem; } .body-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; } .what-is-section { background: var(--reading); }
	.why-section { padding: 90px 0; background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--paper); border-top: 5px solid var(--amber); } .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, .9fr); gap: clamp(34px, 8vw, 130px); } .eyebrow-light { color: #f2a56f; } .why-section h2 { max-width: 660px; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 4vw, 3.7rem); } .why-copy { max-width: 570px; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.55; } .why-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.inclusions-list { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 0 0 32px; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 2px solid var(--charcoal); } .inclusions-list li { padding: 15px 0 15px 34px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 1.0625rem; font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); line-height: 1.45; position: relative; } .inclusions-list li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 23px; left: 4px; width: 13px; height: 7px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--amber); border-left: 3px solid var(--amber); transform: rotate(-45deg); } .resource-line a { color: var(--amber-text); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); text-decoration-color: var(--amber); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px; } .teams-section { background: #ece8e0; } .team-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center; margin-top: 32px; } .audience-section { padding-bottom: 104px; }
	.closing-actions { padding: 76px 0; background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--paper); border-top: 5px solid var(--amber); } .closing-actions h2 { max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); } .closing-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; } .closing-actions .secondary-cta { color: var(--paper); } .closing-actions .secondary-cta:hover { background: var(--paper); border-color: var(--paper); color: var(--charcoal); } .attribution { margin: 32px 0 0; color: #b9c1bc; font-size: var(--type-caption); }
	@media (max-width: 760px) { .csm-hero { padding: 80px 0 62px; } .hero-grid, .content-grid, .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .credential-panel { width: min(100%, 280px); } .content-grid { gap: 22px; } .why-section { padding: 68px 0; } .why-grid { gap: 28px; } .section { padding: 72px 0; } .audience-section { padding-bottom: 74px; } .closing-actions { padding: 64px 0; } .primary-cta, .team-actions .secondary-cta, .closing-links .secondary-cta { width: 100%; } .closing-links { display: grid; } }
</style>
